quality, drawdown, and oscillation families.

Distinct from existing library (mom skip-5, vol-of-vol, vix-beta, rng_pos,
skew, dside_ratio, macro betas). Gate: abs(IC)>=0.0070 & abs(ICIR)>=0.0840 at h=10.
